!experiments/data/README.md

# The experiment pipeline's own virtualenv (torch, pykt-toolkit): kept out of
# the Django environment on purpose (8b-2).
experiments/.venv/

# Logs of detached pipeline runs. A full H2 pass takes hours, so it is started
# with setsid and survives the shell that launched it; the log is where its
# progress is read from. The results themselves are committed.
experiments/.runs/
